    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19221" body-key="">
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾰλᾰν-ίζω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρῦν,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shake acorns from</i> the oak,
			hence as prov. answer to beggars, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλην δρῦν βαλάνιζε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					11.417
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Zen.
				2.41
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάλανος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.6
				</span></i>
			) <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. τινά</span>
			<i>administer a suppository to</i> him, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				10.150
			</span></i>.</div>
	</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
